␀␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): bad arguments
␀␀␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): malloc failed
␀␀␀remove␀␀rmdir␀␀␀/spiffs␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): rmdir is unnecessary in SPIFFS
␀␀VFSFileImpl␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): strdup(%s) failed
␀␀␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): fopen(%s) failed
␀␀␀␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): opendir(%s) failed
␀␀[%6u][E][%s:%u] %s(): Unknown type 0x%08X for file %s
